  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\">一款Fabric模組，可在螢幕上顯示遊戲中的FPS<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/336/271/mod-preview.png\" alt=\"模組預覽畫面\" width=\"1903\" height=\"1008\"></p><p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">📗</span>&nbsp;</span><strong>關於：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">此模組會在螢幕上顯示當前FPS數值。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">支援從最新版Minecraft至1.14.4版本。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">需安裝<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252fuse%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric Loader</a>才能使用！</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>🐞錯誤與問題：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\">請至<a href=\"https://github.com/Grayray75/FPS-Display/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a>回報任何錯誤或問題。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">❔</span>常見問題：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\">會移植此模組到Forge嗎？</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"> <strong>不會</strong></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;color:#000\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">可以在我的模組包中使用此模組嗎？</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#000\">可以</span></strong></span></span></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
